{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SA8XmZfS8sc9qG3hkbdnSp","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 entrainment_gated_ft 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (11 个)\\n\\n- **exp-010**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp-011**: RUNNING — \\n- **exp-001**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp-008**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp-003-p2v2**: PREPARING (killed) — \\n- **exp-003-p2**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **exp-003**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **exp-009**: DONE (success) — \\n- **eval_340m_retnet_hgrn2**: DONE (success) — \\n- **hgrn2_eval_h3_1**: DONE (success) — \\n- **hgrn2_eval_1_3b_all**: DONE (killed) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-19\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\n| exp-011 | Cross-architecture variance on additional retrieval-dependent benchmarks (StoryCloze, BoolQ, COPA, PIQA, SciQ) decreases monotonically with attention ratio, providing a second statistically significant anchor (exact permutation p<0.05, two-tailed) beyond LAMBADA after Bonferroni correction | — | — | — |\\n\\n## 待处理\\n- exp-003-p2v2: Helped samples have higher pure-model perplexity (model uncertain → attention helped) while hurt samples have lower perplexity (model confident → attention interfered), with architecture-specific patterns across GDN/RetNet/HGRN2. Retry with HGRN2 monkey-patch fix for _tied_weights_keys AttributeError.（准备中）\\n\\n## 近期结论\\n- **exp-010** (success): Aggregate convergence (cross-arch std decreasing with attention ratio) and per-example divergence (low Jaccard of helped/hurt sets) co-evolve as attention ratio increases on LAMBADA — demonstrating underspecification: architectures converge in aggregate performance while helping/hurting almost entirely different samples ← 基于 exp-001\\n- **exp-001** (success): Cross-architecture variance (std) on retrieval-dependent tasks decreases monotonically with attention ratio at 1.3B scale, while reasoning-dependent tasks show no convergence — establishing task-specificity as a principled feature of the equalizer effect, not a limitation\\n  [task_specificity_results](/api/workspace-files/projects/entrainment_gated_ft/artifacts/exp-001/data/task_specificity_results.csv) | [task_specificity_figure](/api/workspace-files/projects/entrainment_gated_ft/artifacts/exp-001/chart/task_specificity_figure_info.txt)\\n- **exp-008** (success): Replacing scipy.stats.spearmanr asymptotic p-values with exact permutation tests (n=5, 120 permutations, two-tailed) corrects the spurious p=1.4e-24 bug; expected: LAMBADA raw p≈0.017, Bonferroni adj-p≈0.100 (not significant), confirming need for additional benchmarks ← 基于 exp-001\\n\\n## 趋势\\n成功 6 / 负向 2 / 失败 0 / 共 9\\n\\n## 下一步\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\n\\n## 资源状态\\nwestb-48145: 无 GPU 信息\\n\\n## 告警\\n- hgrn2_eval_1_3b_all: 已被终止 — unknown\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01RzgktuWx7HvTRaCoEMfsgu","session_id":"ea776f88-99f6-408d-b413-74df3cce9548","uuid":"f7b9d9b9-33f0-489e-a16d-47e939bf4371","timestamp":"2026-05-19T15:40:41.440Z"}
